  "evidencia": "Page: Dubai Textile Souk. Sentence: The Dubai Textile Souk (Arabic: سوق الغزل والنسيج‎ ‎ ; also known as the Old Textile Souk) is a traditional souq (market) of textile products located in Dubai's historic Bur Dubai neighbourhood.\nPage: Dubai Textile Souk. Sentence: Opposite to the textile souk on the other side of the Dubai Creek lie the Dubai Spice Souk and Dubai Gold Souk in Deira, accessible via the creek by special abra boats.\nPage: Dubai Gold Souk. Sentence: The souk consists of over 300 retailers, most of whom are jewellery traders.\nPage: Iranian Mosque, Bur Dubai. Sentence: The Iranian Mosque (also known as the Ali ibn Abi Talib Iranian Mosque) is a Shia mosque located near the old Textile Souk in the Bur Dubai district of Dubai, United Arab Emirates.",
